Error [E1299]: store path rejected: `CON`
 Why: Hangar Store v2 path law (reserved) forbids this name: Windows reserved device name.
 Fix: rename the entry to a portable store path: no reserved Windows names, no trailing `.`/` `, no case-fold collisions with a sibling, and no `.`/`..` components.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1299
